{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今集《美食新聞報道》由陳國強師傅帶領主持林映暉（暉哥）遠赴吉隆坡，造訪廖偉雄（燦神）當地開設的餐廳。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">去到玲瓏西刀魚蛋檔，率先登場的「西刀魚蛋麵」，湯底以魚肉、豬骨及雞肉熬製，味道濃郁鮮甜。幼身的麵條非常彈牙；而呈不規則形狀的西刀魚蛋，全以馬來西亞西刀魚手打而成，肉質鮮甜細嫩，口感柔軟彈牙。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">接着上菜的「燦神叉燒」有別於一般梅頭叉燒，特別選用豬腩肉製作。烤製時逼出多餘油脂並牢牢鎖住肉汁，達至入口即化的效果；肥瘦間層次分明，脂肪軟滑甘香，瘦肉則緊實惹味。另一道「龍躉片」選用厚切深海大龍躉，肉質紮實鮮甜，連魚皮也滑溜彈牙。一口咬下魚油香氣四溢，由於沒有添加過多調味，完美展現了原汁原味的清淡鮮香。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">小食方面，「炸魚餅」外皮炸得微焦硬脆，蘸上酸辣的秘製醬汁同吃，刺激味蕾；至於「炸豆卜」則外脆內軟，裡面釀入的手剁豬肉鮮味突出，口感層次同樣豐富！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">玲瓏西刀魚蛋檔</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：No. 1-1, Jalan Tun Perak 2, Taman Tun Perak, 43200 Cheras, Selangor, Malaysia</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"37aa9518-9b91-495b-9576-00b00a334b30.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026dDbFYKhKh81784863896.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"37aa9518-9b91-495b-9576-00b00a334b30.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"440ed4a0-3201-47b2-8bdc-da12847dda07.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026y916gWQ0vd1784865587.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"440ed4a0-3201-47b2-8bdc-da12847dda07.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7e53abd5-0f19-4b3a-9d1c-cd30e181bbd9.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026lTDktSmpaL1784865758.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7e53abd5-0f19-4b3a-9d1c-cd30e181bbd9.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"bfa20be5-1bd2-4cbb-aba2-2061f15f3ca1.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026zZv72XIMDG1784865811.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"bfa20be5-1bd2-4cbb-aba2-2061f15f3ca1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">來到第二節，主持施焯日（Arthur）與黃婧靈（波波）帶大家到尖東掃街，品嚐港式地道風味。率先登場的「細牛雜」包含了牛骨髓、牛脆骨及牛小腸。牛骨髓外形神似乾瑤柱，入口微黏，味道清甜淡雅；牛脆骨則是連接喉部與肺部的環狀軟骨，外層軟滑、內裏爽脆，口感猶如豬耳般層次豐富，且牛味濃郁；至於牛小腸則極為肥美，處理得毫無腥味，入口帶着脂香與清甜，邪惡度滿分！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">兩人隨後轉戰品嚐凍滷水。「細生腸」口感極為彈牙，滷水香氣突出，配上濃淡得宜的醬汁，味道恰到好處。「墨魚」新鮮清甜，咬落爽口；而「火雞腎」的份量比一般大塊，肉質不但不韌，反而十分爽脆惹味。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"36264cdc-652a-4a91-8c14-7a24ef4a599e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20269q8ZqjSEt71784865831.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"36264cdc-652a-4a91-8c14-7a24ef4a599e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3f0aa471-e186-4209-b2e1-8ba330946ec8.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026LL1ed6THdi1784865838.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3f0aa471-e186-4209-b2e1-8ba330946ec8.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6ca3a38d-6d4f-4db8-bd49-f8887940b450.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026m6EuLcDsiy1784865842.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6ca3a38d-6d4f-4db8-bd49-f8887940b450.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fd0c5242-3cac-4399-83ee-5b93b33ebea3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026rdgtdbAlNr1784865848.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fd0c5242-3cac-4399-83ee-5b93b33ebea3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">隨後交由另一主持蔡景行（行仔）接棒，帶大家品嚐巨星謝霆鋒最愛的蛋撻！新鮮出爐的「招牌蛋撻」咬下極為鬆化，曲奇皮鬆脆可口，蛋漿軟滑且蛋香濃郁，這款星級蛋撻只售街坊價4.5元。另一款經典「雞尾包」內餡裹滿椰絲，入口甜而不膩；帶有嚼勁的椰絲與麵包的烘焙香氣完美融合，配搭恰到好處！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鴻昇餅店</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：筲箕灣金華街20號地舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"dff238e0-1a53-43d7-9d7d-716d275d2de7.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20261FQGELZ52Z1784865858.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"dff238e0-1a53-43d7-9d7d-716d275d2de7.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1063d3c8-a73e-4253-a000-920a67180316.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026VQcDTwN47m1784865863.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1063d3c8-a73e-4253-a000-920a67180316.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-24T13:39:41.891418+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":888,"images":10,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}